       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PERFORM-VARYING-TABLE-EX.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TABLE.
          05 WS-ITEM PIC 9(3) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
       01 WS-I     PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       01 WS-SUM   PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5
              COMPUTE WS-ITEM(WS-I) = WS-I * 10
              ADD WS-ITEM(WS-I) TO WS-SUM
           END-PERFORM.
           DISPLAY "SUM=" WS-SUM.
           STOP RUN.
